<p>The little horn of Daniel 7 emerges from the fourth beast — universally recognized as representing Rome. It arises among ten horns (the divided Roman Empire) and uproots three of them. It speaks great words against the Most High, persecutes the saints for "a time, times, and the dividing of time" (1,260 years), and thinks to change "times and laws."</p>
