<p>The word "true" (<em>alethinos</em>) means genuine, real, original. The heavenly sanctuary is the <em>original</em>; the earthly was the copy. Moses was shown the pattern in the mount and instructed to make the earthly after it — this implies the heavenly original already existed.</p>
